* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py


* Project model: applied version 1
* Ideal fully differential difference amplifier: Vout+ - Vout- = A*((INP1-INN1)+(INP2-INN2))
.subckt dda inp1 inn1 inp2 inn2 outp outn
E1 outp n1 inp1 inn1 2.5e5
E2 n1 0 inp2 inn2 2.5e5
E3 outn n2 inn1 inp1 2.5e5
E4 n2 0 inn2 inp2 2.5e5
.ends dda

.subckt dut Vs1 Vs2 Vodp Vodn VCM
R1 VCM net1 1k
R2 net1 Vodp 1k
R3 VCM net0 1k
R4 net0 Vodn 1k
X1 Vs1 Vs2 net0 net1 Vodp Vodn dda
.ends dut
